{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別握手会in東京!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ始まりますねーおいシャン個握(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは1部と2部で握手するけ待ってますー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の個握ね。４月以来!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長くお話できるから、個握好きーよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あこの前のアンケートの話なんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日好きになった人も、何年も前からひめたんがずっと好きな人も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大切なひめきゅんさんよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いしまーすね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は握手会の質問をどどどどどーん(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9日私誕生日だったからひめたんからお祝いして欲しいなぁ( *´艸｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステキな1年になりますようにー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手の時とかに、「お兄ちゃん」って呼んでもらうのはアリかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリだと思うよおにいちゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー言ってみた(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、ひめたんに向かってかわいくお願いしてみましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが時々使う「ほえー」が好きなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で会ったら言ってくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほえー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー言ってみた(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、ひめたんに向かってかわいくお願いしてみましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...この返事の流れ、デジャヴ。わら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で何話せばいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か聞きたいことがあったら質問とかも受け付けるし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相談してほしいことあったらそれも聞くし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何も話すことなければひたすら手握ってても、ね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく何でもオッケーよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルの握手会なんて一度も参加した事が無いけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはいわゆる在宅ファンをどう思います？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり直接会いに来てくれる方が嬉しいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直に答えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー確かに、ひめたん最近まで広島住んでたから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなアイドルさんアーティストさんに会いに行くなんてできんかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、もし直接会えるんなら会いたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり「いつもありがとう」って目を見て言いたいし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の個別握手会コスプレでセーラー服でお願いできる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服かあ。ひめたんセーラー服持ってないんだ...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物真似、生で見てみたいなー（●＾o＾●）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他になにかレパートリーあるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物まねかあー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにはななせまる(西野七瀬chan)しかできんけれども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせまるの物まねでいいんなら全力でやりますよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のあとに何かやってることとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記憶の整理(ω)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女性の方と握手したことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるあるいっぱいあります＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子に好かれるの嬉しいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あもちろん男の子に好かれるのも嬉しいよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子の握手会の特権は、ガールズトークができること。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺はひめたんからしたらお兄さん何だけど下に弟しかいなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹みたいなひめたんと上手く話せるか不安です...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは普通にお友達だと思って、いつもコメントするようなノリで話してくれたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然問題ないと思うよー♪ひめたんフレンドリーだもーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でひめたんビームやってくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別の時に「ひめたんビーム」リクエストしてもいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に行けば沢山ひめたんビームくらえるのかな??笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で会話がとぎれたらひめたんビームやってもらおうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で 俺もビームだしたら ひめたんビームやってくれる??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビーム握手会とかでやってくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でひめたんビーム撃ってくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これいっちゃん多かった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこと言われたら本気でビーム飛ばしてやるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"救護室も用意してもらうからね？覚悟しときなさーいな(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビームとさゆりんごパンチはどっちが強いの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごぱんちと闘ったことないわぁ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと闘ってみよかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにさゆりんごビームとは闘ってみたことあるのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも強くていいかんじだった気がするよ確か♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/15/7186135/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日待ってるよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}